{"id":604,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"選択と探究を軸に個性を伸ばす女子教育","feature_description":"金蘭会は、生徒一人ひとりの変化や挑戦に合わせた柔軟なカリキュラムを通じ、自分らしい進路を考える女子教育を行います。英語・数学は習熟度別に学び、高校では学年が進むほど選択科目と自ら学びを設計する時間を広げます。地域や企業とも協働する探究、留学や海外大学進学も視野に入れた国際教育に加え、茶道・華道・礼法などの学びを通して日本文化への理解も深めます。","clubs":[{"id":11441,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11442,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11443,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11444,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11445,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11446,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11447,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11448,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11449,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11450,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11451,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11452,"name":"E.S.S部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11453,"name":"ダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kinran.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11454,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","s